test_baremetal_clock_contract:
[clock contract] 7 configured positives; 70 named clock refusals; system-clock ordering and non-cache Scala refusals; no output on failure
test_rom_clock_contract:
[clock contract] 7 ROMs match configured Milan clocks; applicable default-clock and system-clock controls differ
test_tap_clock_docs:
[clock contract] 7 tap conversions and presence declarations match configurations
test_clock_crossing_constraints:
test_control_placement_key:
  [gate 23n] 7 configs, 4 shipping the split, each split variant differing from its all-fabric one in CTRL_SPLIT_P = 1 and --ctrl-mailbox --ctrl-firmware <its split image> alone; 3 bad keys refused by name; a split key naming the fabric firmware refused; the flip reverted at 8x8 refused
test_placement_recipe:
  [gate 23o] 7 configs: each placement recipe loads to the config stating it, writes the stated argv and changes no tracked file; the two placements' 9 shape artifacts byte for byte equal but for the firmware_version in 2; --write-rtl, --write-fragment and an unknown placement refused by name; 2 planted recipes and 3 planted artifacts refused
test_bad_configs_rejected:
  [gate 5] 7/7 invalid configs rejected with ConfigError
test_datapath_params_match_the_instance:
  [gate 23m] 11 real milan_soc.py elaborations in 8 s: for every config the integer parameters Instance("milan_datapath") receives are exactly eb.datapath_params(), the shapes the publication census elaborates; every other keyword is a ROM image path
test_gptp_clock_accuracy_per_board:
  [gate 26c] clockAccuracy per board (#843): the AX7101 build's image carries --clock-accuracy 0x22 and the Arty's 0xFE, each byte-equal to the generator's image for gptp_ucode_args() and different under the other value; values outside IEEE 1588-2008 Table 6 refused; milan_dp's gptp and gptp-lat legs run those two configs and grade the Announce octet on the wire
test_station_mac_ul_bit_warns:
  7 configs: decided identity, no zero octet, one U/L-bit warning each
  U/L bit alone decides the warning: 2 universal variants silent, 2 local warn
  CLI: warning on stderr, exit 0, outputs written
test_gptp_latency_corrections_are_declared_and_carried:
test_gptp_latency_writable_key:

